! TRDEP.DBG - DEPOSIT to the PSL setting T (part N, which doesn't trace
! itself): does the program trace itself after it, and does STEP give
! its handler the traces?
SET STEP INSTRUCTION
SET BREAK N1
GO
EXAMINE PSL
DEPOSIT/WORD PSL = 10
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE PSL
EXAMINE TCOUNT
STEP
EXAMINE TCOUNT
GO
